# Storybook

Every component must have stories covering states, variations, and edge cases. Document props, usage, and accessibility in autodocs.

Align reference designs with the [GOV.UK Design System – Community Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/Uim7G5Td35hg5PTGQ79OA1/GOV.UK-Design-System--Community-?node-id=23-233). Use `parameters.design` with the matching Figma URL:

```ts
const meta: Meta<typeof Heading> = {
  title: 'Foundation/Headings',
  component: Heading,
  tags: ['autodocs'],
  parameters: {
    docs: { description: { component: '...' } },
    design: {
      type: 'figma',
      url: 'https://www.figma.com/design/Uim7G5Td35hg5PTGQ79OA1/GOV.UK-Design-System--Community-?node-id=484-9'
    }
  }
}
```
